Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start process to find a DS through ONS Bootstrapping") -> action(n2,"is the input a URN") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n3,"perform ONS Resolving URN to a domain name") -> converge(c1) -> action(n5,"is the input a URN or URL") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n7,"if URL continue process") -> converge(c2) -> action(n11,"link to designated DS") -> action(n12,"process ends") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start process to find a DS through ONS Bootstrapping") -> action(n2,"is the input a URN") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n4,"continue process with input as URL") -> converge(c1) -> action(n5,"is the input a URN or URL") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n7,"if URL continue process") -> converge(c2) -> action(n11,"link to designated DS") -> action(n12,"process ends") -> end(e1)